#: cmd/quickstart.py:256
msgid ""
"You have two options for placing the build directory for Sphinx output.\n"
"Either, you use a directory \"_build\" within the root path, or you "
"separate\n"
"\"source\" and \"build\" directories within the root path."
msgstr "对于放置 Sphinx 输出的构建目录，您有两个选择。一是使用根路径中的 \"_build\" 目录，二是在根路径中分离 \"source\" 和 \"build\" 目录。"

#: cmd/quickstart.py:263
msgid "Separate source and build directories (y/n)"
msgstr "分离源目录和构建目录 (y/n)"

#: cmd/quickstart.py:269
msgid ""
"Inside the root directory, two more directories will be created; "
"\"_templates\"\n"
"for custom HTML templates and \"_static\" for custom stylesheets and other "
"static\n"
"files. You can enter another prefix (such as \".\") to replace the "
"underscore."
msgstr "在根目录内，还将创建两个目录：\"_templates\" 用于自定义 HTML 模板，\"_static\" 用于自定义样式表和其他静态文件。您可以输入其他前缀（如 \".\"）来替代下划线。"

