msgstr "作者姓名"

#: cmd/quickstart.py:291
msgid ""
"Sphinx has the notion of a \"version\" and a \"release\" for the\n"
"software. Each version can have multiple releases. For example, for\n"
"Python the version is something like 2.5 or 3.0, while the release is\n"
"something like 2.5.1 or 3.0a1. If you don't need this dual structure,\n"
"just set both to the same value."
msgstr "Sphinx 对软件有 \"version\"（版本）和 \"release\"（发布版本）的概念。每个版本可以有多个发布版本。例如，Python 的版本是 2.5 或 3.0，而发布版本是 2.5.1 或 3.0a1。如果您不需要这种双重结构，只需将两者设置为相同的值。"

#: cmd/quickstart.py:299
msgid "Project version"
msgstr "项目版本"

#: cmd/quickstart.py:301
msgid "Project release"
msgstr "项目发布版本"

#: cmd/quickstart.py:306
msgid ""
"If the documents are to be written in a language other than English,\n"
"you can select a language here by its language code. Sphinx will then\n"
"translate text that it generates into that language.\n"
"\n"
"For a list of supported codes, see\n"
"https://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/usage/configuration.html#confval-"
"language."
msgstr "如果文档要使用英语以外的语言编写，您可以在此处通过语言代码选择语言。Sphinx 将把其生成的文本翻译为该语言。\n\n支持的语言代码列表，请参见\nhttps://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/usage/configuration.html#confval-language。"

